@baseUrl = http://localhost:5087

### All products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### Only widgets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?category=widgets

### Place an order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-7",
  "lines": [
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": 4, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Get the order (paste the orderId from the response above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/cust-7/orders/fd3277c708894a26a38c8a8f1475c739

### Broken rule: should give 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "cust-7", "lines": [] }

### Not enough stock: should end up Rejected (Widget Mini has only 3)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-8",
  "lines": [ { "productId": 3, "quantity": 5 } ]
}

### Ship an order (warehouse)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/cust-7/orders/fd3277c708894a26a38c8a8f1475c739/ship

### Shipping a Rejected order: should give 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/cust-8/orders/f220bc08355e4f7da1bdf4546304af35/ship

### Order processing metric for this month
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/metrics/order-processing?month=2026-11


### Upload image: Widget Basic (id 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1/image
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="widget-basic.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ../TestData/Images/widget-basic.png
--WebAppBoundary--

